        "original_id": "743f28a2-7820-5d7d-a2bc-5182e09d1d94",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francesca Annis, Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas, Prince\n- Films and TV: Under the Cherry Moon, Lillie, Howard the Duck\n- Organizations and Awards: BAFTA TV Awards, Golden Raspberry Awards, ITV, The Time\n\nFacts:\n- In 1979, Francesca Annis won the BAFTA TV Award for Best Actress for the ITV serial \"Lillie\".\n- Francesca Annis was a six-time BAFTA TV Award nominee.\n- Kristin Scott Thomas made her feature film debut in \"Under the Cherry Moon\".\n- \"Under the Cherry Moon\" starred Jerome Benton, a former member of The Time, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas, and Francesca Annis.\n- At the 7th Golden Raspberry Awards, the Razzies had their first tie for Worst Picture between \"Howard the Duck\" and \"Under the Cherry Moon\".",
